#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:134
msgid ""
"This method belongs to the shipping zone you are editing, so free shipping "
"is only ever offered to the countries, states and postcodes of that zone. "
"You can add it as many times as you need, each copy with its own conditions."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:135
msgid "the name the customer reads at checkout. APG Free Shipping by default."
