#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:140
msgid "When shipping is free"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:142
msgid ""
"What the cart has to meet before this method shows up. With nothing set, "
"shipping is free for everyone in the zone."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:143
msgid ""
"the condition: nothing, a valid free shipping coupon, a minimum order "
"amount, either of the two, or both at once."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:144
msgid ""
"how much the customer has to spend. It only counts when the condition above "
"asks for an amount."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:145
msgid ""
"whether that amount is compared against the total with taxes or without "
"them. Unticked, which is how it comes, taxes are left out."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:146
msgid ""
"a weight above which shipping stops being free, however much the order "
"costs. Leave it at zero to switch it off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:151
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:153
msgid ""
"What never travels free. There are five pairs of settings, one for product "
"categories, tags, attributes, shipping classes and user roles, and the two "
"in each pair work together."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:154
msgid "No shipping (...)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:154
msgid ""
"the list of categories, tags, attributes, shipping classes or roles that do "
"not get free shipping. Leave a list empty and nothing is excluded by it. "
"With more than five hundred entries the list turns into a search box, so you "
"type instead of scrolling."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:155
msgid "Shipping (...)?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:155
msgid ""
"turns the list around: ticked, free shipping is offered only for what is on "
"the list and for nothing else."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:160
msgid "At checkout"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:162
msgid ""
"Which payment methods and which other shipping methods can be used together "
"with this one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:163
msgid ""
"the payment methods the customer is offered when choosing free shipping. "
"Useful for leaving cash on delivery out of an order that travels free."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:164
msgid ""
"the other shipping methods of the same zone that are shown alongside this "
"one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:165
msgid ""
"hides every other shipping cost whenever free shipping is available, so the "
"customer cannot pay for something that is already free."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:170
msgid "How it looks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:172
