#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:173
msgid ""
"the address of an image to show with the method, typically the carrier logo. "
"60x21 pixels works well."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:174
msgid ""
"where the icon goes: before the title, after it, or on its own with no title "
"at all."
msgstr ""

#: includes/clases/class-apg-free-shipping-help.php:175
msgid ""
"a free text shown under the method, such as 24 to 48 hours. Leave it empty "
"and nothing is shown."
msgstr ""

